<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Revvia collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us."
  path="/privacy"
  updated="October 2026"
>
  <p>Revvia ("we," "us") operates this website. This policy explains what we collect and how we use it. By using the site you agree to this policy.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> when you submit the Growth Audit form or subscribe, we collect your name, business name, email, store URL, budget range, contact preference, and any message you send.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> we use Google Analytics 4 and the Meta Pixel to understand how the site is used. These set cookies and collect anonymized usage data. Our default consent posture denies advertising storage; analytics is used in aggregate.</li>
    <li><strong>Embedded video:</strong> our homepage reel is embedded from Vimeo. When you play it, Vimeo may set its own cookies and collect playback data under Vimeo's own privacy policy.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your inquiry and prepare your growth audit.</li>
    <li>To improve the site and measure marketing performance in aggregate.</li>
    <li>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Form submissions</h2>
  <p>Form submissions are processed by Netlify Forms and may be routed to our team's email and an internal Google Sheet. We retain submissions only as long as needed to follow up.</p>

  <h2>AI Visibility Check</h2>
  <p>The free check on the AI Visibility page asks OpenAI (ChatGPT), Perplexity, and Anthropic (Claude) the same questions a homeowner might ask, through each company's official API. We send the trade, the city, and the question. We do not send your passwords. Those companies process the questions under their own privacy policies.</p>
  <p>We store the check so we can show your result and prepare the full report: your business name, city, trade, website, and the answers we received. That check record is kept for 90 days and then deleted. We also store a one-way hash of your IP address to enforce rate limits. We do not store the raw IP on the check.</p>
  <p>Before the check runs, Cloudflare Turnstile checks that a person submitted the form. Cloudflare receives a token and your IP address for that request, under Cloudflare's privacy policy.</p>
  <p>If you tick the consent box, we email the full report and a few short follow-up emails from tim@revvia.com. You can unsubscribe at any time by replying "unsubscribe" or by using the <a href="/unsubscribe">unsubscribe page</a>. We stop follow-up emails when that request comes in.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can decline cookies through your browser settings and unsubscribe from emails at any time. To request access to or deletion of your data, email <a href="mailto:tim@revvia.com">tim@revvia.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Revvia (First Door, LLC), 5927 Priestly Drive, Suite 212, Carlsbad, CA 92008. Email <a href="mailto:info@revvia.com">info@revvia.com</a>, phone <a href="tel:+17607822875">(760) 782-2875</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
